{"id":"72d2de02f3f75f65","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-nno-induction.md","title":"Theorem — 自然数对象的子对象归纳原理","display":"Theorem — 自然数对象的子对象归纳原理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-nno-induction","aliases":["14-thm-nno-induction"],"display":"Theorem — 自然数对象的子对象归纳原理","depends_on":["[[14-df-natural-numbers-object]]","[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]"],"source_location":"VI.1, printed 268–269; DjVu 140; consequence of NNO universal property","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-nno-induction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-nno-induction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 自然数对象的子对象归纳原理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8ee22b56cc1189dc\" href=\"?note=8ee22b56cc1189dc\" title=\"14-df-natural-numbers-object\">14-df-natural-numbers-object</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" href=\"?note=8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" title=\"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism\">14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"VI.1, printed 268–269; DjVu 140; consequence of NNO universal property"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；以下范畴及 Hom 集在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中处理。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为初等拓扑斯，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(N,z,s)\">\\((N,z,s)\\)</span> 为自然数对象。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:A\\to N\">\\(m:A\\to N\\)</span> 为单态射（<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" href=\"?note=8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" title=\"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism\">14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism</a>），给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:1\\to A\">\\(a:1\\to A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r:A\\to A\">\\(r:A\\to A\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\circ a=z\">\\(m\\circ a=z\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\circ r=s\\circ m\">\\(m\\circ r=s\\circ m\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(N,A)\\;(m\\circ u=\\operatorname{id}_N\\land u\\circ m=\\operatorname{id}_A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(N,A)\\;(m\\circ u=\\operatorname{id}_N\\land u\\circ m=\\operatorname{id}_A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源说明：以下来源定位与历史核对经历为所附原稿的记录；本次核对对象为本对话提供的数学笔记。</p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,a,r)\">\\((A,a,r)\\)</span> 应用自然数对象泛性质，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"uz=a\">\\(uz=a\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"us=ru\">\\(us=ru\\)</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"mu\">\\(mu\\)</span> 保持 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 的零和后继；恒等箭头也如此，由唯一性得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"mu=1_N\">\\(mu=1_N\\)</span>。再由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m(um)=m=m1_A\">\\(m(um)=m=m1_A\\)</span> 及单态射消去得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"um=1_A\">\\(um=1_A\\)</span>。这证明任何含零且对后继封闭的子对象就是全体；不把“每个全局自然数点属于子对象”误当成内部归纳。</p>\n<p>原稿记录曾读取原书本地 DjVu OCR，并目视核对 DjVu 140 的印刷页 268–269；以下证明为笔记内展开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-natural-numbers-object","status":"resolved","id":"8ee22b56cc1189dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-numbers-object]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism","status":"resolved","id":"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism","status":"resolved","id":"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，$(N,z,s)$ 为自然数对象。$m:A\\to N$ 为单态射（[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]），给定 $a:1\\to A$、$r:A\\to A$ 满足 $m\\circ a=z$、$m\\circ r=s\\circ m$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"(N,z,s)","display":false},{"tex":"m:A\\to N","display":false},{"tex":"a:1\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"r:A\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"m\\circ a=z","display":false},{"tex":"m\\circ r=s\\circ m","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(N,A)\\;(m\\circ u=\\operatorname{id}_N\\land u\\circ m=\\operatorname{id}_A).","display":true},{"tex":"(A,a,r)","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"uz=a","display":false},{"tex":"us=ru","display":false},{"tex":"mu","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"mu=1_N","display":false},{"tex":"m(um)=m=m1_A","display":false},{"tex":"um=1_A","display":false}],"bytes":1710,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-153","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-nno-induction|thm-257 — 自然数对象的子对象归纳原理]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-114","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-nno-induction]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-271","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-nno-induction]]"},{"id":"d0faa5e1a984aebe","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-193","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-nno-induction]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-154","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-nno-induction|thm-257 — 自然数对象的子对象归纳原理]]"}],"outgoing":["8ee22b56cc1189dc","8e7f6de1ab6fc49f"]}